{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/SON-Wishlist.gif?t=1746551481\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Unsettled Seas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a cursed pirate captain to play as that can possess bodies, wield brute force, or charm contacts to build a haven in the Caribbean. Each captain plays radically different, from soul-trading merchants to illiterate werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/wormonster.gif?t=1746551481\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coordinate Brutal Naval Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in exhilarating naval battles with a pirate vessel of your own making. Fight dirty or honorably with skills befit of a seafaring corsair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/1v1.gif?t=1746551481\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge sandbox-world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your fleet in tactical battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supply &amp; demand trade system, affected by piracy, random events, &amp; conflicts. When items are abundant, the prices go down and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of random events from people being publicly hanged, diseases spreading, sailors smuggling contraband and so much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction in Seadogs of Nassau offers unique perks to the player, from strong ships to powerful ports.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world continues to evolve with or without your intervention. Factions will still attack each other, ports will run out of supplies, pirates will go on raids, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911760?t=1746551481","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911760?t=1746551481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746551481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746551481","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/SON-Wishlist.gif?t=1746551481\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Unsettled Seas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a cursed pirate captain to play as that can possess bodies, wield brute force, or charm contacts to build a haven in the Caribbean. Each captain plays radically different, from soul-trading merchants to illiterate werewolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/wormonster.gif?t=1746551481\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Coordinate Brutal Naval Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in exhilarating naval battles with a pirate vessel of your own making. Fight dirty or honorably with skills befit of a seafaring corsair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/1v1.gif?t=1746551481\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A huge sandbox-world to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your fleet in tactical battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supply &amp; demand trade system, affected by piracy, random events, &amp; conflicts. When items are abundant, the prices go down and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of random events from people being publicly hanged, diseases spreading, sailors smuggling contraband and so much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each faction in Seadogs of Nassau offers unique perks to the player, from strong ships to powerful ports.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world continues to evolve with or without your intervention. Factions will still attack each other, ports will run out of supplies, pirates will go on raids, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["Oni Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/header.jpg?t=1746551481","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Testt","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SeaDogs Of Nassau","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7, 64-bit Windows 8 (8.1) or 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU Core i5-2500K 3.3GHz / AMD CPU Phenom II X4 940<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GPU GeForce GTX 660 / AMD GPU Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Oni Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","required_age":"12